# Never commit the Bubble export — it contains live secrets
*.bubble

# The legacy design package: 46 MB of binaries git cannot diff, plus licensed
# VAG Rounded Next fonts we are not entitled to redistribute via this repo.
# Stripped from history 2026-08-08 — see docs/decisions.md. The assets live at
# ../Legacy-Application-backup/ (sibling of this repo). Copy the directory back
# in here when a task needs it; this rule keeps it from being committed again.
Legacy-Application/

node_modules/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
# Filled-in secrets, one file per environment. Never committed. See docs/environments.md
.secrets.*.env
.DS_Store
dist/
build/
.expo/
*.log
logs/
planning/.backlog-history/

# Claude Code local state. The agent worktrees were committed as gitlinks (mode
# 160000), which points a clone at repositories that exist only on this machine.
.claude/

# Supabase CLI local link state — contains the linked project ref, not committed
supabase/.temp/
# Written by `supabase start`; local stack state, not source.
supabase/.branches/

# Output of `npm run bundle:check` — proof the app bundles, not source.
.expo-bundle-check/
apps/mobile/.expo-bundle-check/

# Generated by `expo prebuild`. This is a managed (CNG) project: the native projects are
# an output of app.json plus the config plugins, and EAS regenerates them on every build.
# Committing them would let the checked-in copy drift from the plugins that produce it,
# which is the failure `scripts/verify-apk-upi-queries.mjs` exists to catch.
apps/*/android/
apps/*/ios/
